    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūhela kalwīle ka būlūgū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūbabala a banhū abo walī nabo; hūna ūtūūla bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale shihūmbī shihūmbī na b'igan'igana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūbagabanhya a bashilikale bakwe mu magelè mataale adatū hū ūbatūma ū kūjūlwa, igelè līmò ha sīlīlī ya ng'wa Yoabu ng'wana Seluya, līngī ha sīlīlī ya ng'wana Abishai ng'wana wa ng'wawe na Yoabu; lya kadatū ha sīlīlī ya ng'wa Itai, ū Ngītī. Hūna ū ntemi ūbawīla a bashilikale, “Nū nene nakūbiza hamò ning'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū būhaya, “Ū bebe yaya ū kūfuma, nguno ūlū būtūheeba tūbapeela, batūtūdīīlīla a bise, nīyo nūūlū nusu yise īkashila batīko ū kūfung'wa ng'holò; alīyo ū bebe ūlī na mpango gwa banhū shihūmbī ikūmi ū kūlenganījiwa na a bise. Ū bebe ikalaga dūhū ū kūnū ūkūmanūtūtūmīla shiigunanhīlo kūfuma ū mu nzengo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūhaya, “Nakūgwīta būlī mhayo ūyo mulībona gīkī gwigeleelilwe ū mu miso ging'we.” Na lūūlū aho bandya kūja a banhū, ū ntemi wīmīīla ha mita, būyūbīta mu mabità gabo g'igan'igana, na ga shihūmbī shihūmbī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūbakomeleja a ba Yoabu nū Abishai, nū Itai; ūhaya, “Bizagi bapolo ū kūlī nyanda ū Abusalomu kūlwa nguno yane.” Pye a bashilikale būng'wigwa ū ntemi aho alībakomeleja a bataale ba mabità ī ya kūng'wītīla ū Abusalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a bashilikale būsela bajile kwilwisha būlūgū na a Baisilaeli; būūkalwīla ng'wipoolu lya Efulaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī libità lya Baisilaeli lyūpyenelwa ng'wenūmo na a banhū ba ng'wa Daūdi; ū lūshikū lwenūlo būcha banhū bingī no, shihūmbī makūmi abīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū būlūgū būsambaala hose hose ū mu sī yenīyo; ū lūshikū lwenūlo ī bū yūlya banhū bingī kūtinda abo bakabūlagwa bo lūshū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abusalomu kūbūlagwa na Yoabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla ū Abusalomu wapamanya na a banhū ba ng'wa Daūdi, adamhīlile nzobe yakwe. Ī ndamhī yūkabīta ha sīlīlī ya matambī ga ntī ntaale gigwasanije; ū ntwe go ng'wa Abusalomu gwihagīla mu matambī, ī ndamhī īyo walī ayīdamhīlile yūpeela ījile, ūlekwa ū wei wanungeelaga henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmò wa bashilikale ūgūbona ū mhayo gwenūyo, ūūkang'wīla ū Yoabu, “Namona ū Abusalomu wanungeelaga mu līntī!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoabu ūnkomela ū munhū ūyo akang'wīla ū mhayo gwenūyo; ūmūja, “Ūlīhaya kinehe? Wamona gete? Hama wabiza kī ū kūmūlaga? Nīyo ni nakwinha inong'ho lya shipande ikūmi sha feza na nshipi gwa nyashilikale!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūhaya, “Ū nene nūūlū ni kūgelekelwa shipande shihūmbī sha feza hūna ninhwa mu nkono, yaya ū kūngoloolela nkono ū ng'wana wa ntemi. Nguno twigwaga na matū gise gete, ū ntemi alīmulagīja, ū bebe nū Abishai, nū Itai; gīkī, ‘Nang'hanagi ū yanda ū Abusalomu kūlwa nguno yane.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ni nagwītaga ū mhayo gwenūyo ni nabūtūūlaga mu kwihīga kūtaale no ū būpanga wane; nguno ū ntemi atabisagwa mhayo gose gose, hama nīyo ū bebe ni wanikīndīka ū nene kūle no!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoabu ūhaya, “Ū nene natūdūla kwikala nakūdegelekaga ūlīnijimīgīja makanza dalali dūhū!” Na lūūlū ūsola someke idatū ūūkanchima lya ha ng'holò ū Abusalomu, ī likanza lyenīlo walī ataalī mpanga nūūlū īkī walī anuungeelile mu līntī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basūmba ikūmi babūūcha ba shilanga sha ng'wa Yoabu, būng'witinja ū Abusalomu būntūla būmalīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yoabu ūfuula na mhembe ya kūmala būlūgū; a bashilikale booya ū kūbakūūbīja a Baisilaeli, nguno ū Yoabu akafunya shilagīlo sha kooya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abusalomu būnsola būmponya ng'wichongo itaale lyalī ū ng'wipoolu ng'wenūmo; hūna būtūlīīla itūūgo itaale lya mawe a higūlya yakwe. A Baisilaeli pye a bose būpeela, būlī ng'wene ūja kū ng'wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū ja būpanga bokwe ū Abusalomu walī wabeeja ng'hīngī wīyīmīlīja mu longa, lwitanagwa lwa ntemi kūlwa kūng'wizūkwa we, nguno wiganikaga gīkī, “Ū nene natī na ng'wana ngosha wa kūlīlang'hana ī lina lyane lītizūjimīīla.” Na lūūlū ī ng'hīngī yenīyo walī wīyitana lina lyakwe wei ng'wenekīlī; kūshisha nī lelo īyī ītaalī īkwitanagwa ng'hīngī ya ng'wa Abusalomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūnīla Abusalomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Ahimaazi ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Sadoki ūhaya, “Leka napeele ū kūlī ntemi nakang'winhe ī mhola soga, ī ja gīkī ū SEEBA wang'wihūcha ū mu nkono gwa banishi bakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoabu ūng'wīla, “Ū bebe ūtī wa kūtwaala mhola ī lelo, ūkūtwaala lūshikū lūngī; yaya ī lelo nguno ūyo waachaaga ng'wana wa ntemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho ngosha muna Kushi, ū Yoabu ūng'wīla ng'wenūyo, “Jaga ū bebe ūkang'wīle ū ntemi īyo wībonaga.” Ū ngosha wa Kushi ng'wenūyo winama ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Yoabu, hūna ūpeela ajile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla ū Ahimaazi ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Sadoki wang'wīla hangī ū Yoabu, “Ītī na mhayo īyo īlanigwīle, nalīkūlomba ūnizunīlīje nane napeele a ha numa yakwe ū muna Kushi.” Alīyo ū Yoabu ūng'wīla, “Bebe ng'wana wane, ūlīhaya kūja kwīta kī? Ūtūtwalaga mhola jose jose ja kūkwenhela inong'ho!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsūmba nang'hwe ūhaya, “Ndūhū ū mhayo baba, ū nene nalītogwa ū kūpeela ko!” Nose ū Yoabu ūng'wīla, “Ka peelaga shi naheene lūūlū!” Na ng'hana ū Ahimaazi wimeema nhambo, ūbītīla nzīla ya mu mbūga,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18:23",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mbūga:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hū kūhaya sī ya ntubīlo ya mongo gwa Yolodani.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ūneka kū numa ū muna Kushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Daūdi walī wigasha ha gatī gatī ya mibita ībīlī; na munhū wa kūmanūlola walī walinha kwigūlya ya numba, yalī hihī na ndugu; kūlwa kūmanūlola ū kū būlūgū. Ūlinha ū kwigūlya kūlola; aho wabūūcha a miso, ūloleela munhū ūmò alīpeela izile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nang'hani ng'wenūyo ūng'wīla ū ntemi; ntemi nang'hwe ūhaya, “Ūlū alī iyene akūbiza na mhola jawiza ūng'wenūyo.” Nose wegeela ūyo wapeelaga izile ng'wenūyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwitulwa ū noji waloleela ūngī aliza nang'hwe akūpeelaga, ūng'hamukīla ū nang'hani wa ha mita ūhaya, “Ūngī ūyo, nang'hwe akūpeelaga iyene!” Ū ntemi ūhaya, “Nū ng'wenūyo alī na mhola jawiza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyabīta ikanza iguhī ū noji ūhaya, “Ūlū nalola chiza ū wa kwandya alīpeela gītī Ahimaazi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Sadoki.” Ū ntemi ūhaya, “Ū ng'wenūyo ngosha wawiza no, akenhaga mhola jawiza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahimaazi aho washika ūng'wīla ū ntemi n'ilaka lya higūlya lya būtindi; ūhaya, “Yashila wihūka!” Ūtuja mazwi ū kū būtongi wa ntemi, hanuma winama kūshisha ū būshū būkuumya hasī; ūhaya, “Akumīlījiwe ū SEEBA Mulungu wako! Nguno ī lelo wabapyagūla abo balūnsolelaga shilanga ū baba būgonzo ū ntemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūbūūja, “Ū nyanda ū Abusalomu alī mhola a hene?” Ū Ahimaazi ūhaya, “Ū Yoabu aho alīntūma ū ntūmami wa ntemi nū nene ntūmami wako, naalī nabona yakwīla kilii kili, gwike nūleka ū kūdeeba ho chiza ūyo gwalī gwigelaga!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūng'wīla, “Īmīīlaga ha mhūjo aho ūlembeele.” Ng'hana wisunda ha mhūjo wīmīīla henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū muna Kushi nang'hwe ūshikīīla; ūhaya, “Baba būgonzo ntemi, nakwenhela mhola jawiza! Ū SEEBA wakūpīja ī lelo ū mu makono ga bose abo baalūgaagaanaga kwigūngūhya higūlya yako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūmūja nū muna Kushi, “Kinehe ū nyanda ū Abusalomu, alī mhola?” Ū muna Kushi ūshosha, “A banishi ba ng'wa baba būgonzo ū ntemi, na a bose abo bakwigūngūhyaga higūlya yako, babize gīt'ūmo alī ū nsūmba ng'wenūyo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi gwikīla ū mīlī; wīnga ho, ūja mu chumba ha numba ya ha mita henaho; wandya kūlīla ng'hūngū aho ajile; ūyūlīla alīhaya, “Aaga ng'wana wane Abusalomu! Ng'wana wane; ng'wana wane Abusalomu! Yalī hambū hambū ūlū ni nachaaga ū nene a ha ng'wanya gwako! Aaga, Abusalomu ng'wana wane, ng'wana wane!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
